The customer is unhappy about a refund{% if case.subcategory %} ({{ case.subcategory | lower }}){% endif %}.

1. Acknowledge that waiting for money back is stressful.
2. State the refund's status exactly as the facts give it (amount, date issued, method). If the facts don't include it, say the team is checking and don't estimate.
3. If a refund was issued, say how long banks typically take to show it only if the facts give that timeframe.

Never promise a date or amount that isn't in the facts.
